    * Link 1        : Frekuensi 6 GHz (Lebar Pita 320 MHz)
- Tx Power          : 20.0 dBm
- Rate Adaptation   : IdealWifiManager (Otomatis menyesuaikan hingga 4096-QAM)
- Propagation Model : HybridBuildingsPropagationLossModel (Redaman Tembok/Indoor)
- Jarak Uji         : 0 hingga 640 meter
- Target Throughput : 2.5 Gbps (Injeksi UDP)
